        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mulungu ali'mupa lu'v'ango Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lu'mo, Mulungu wamuwi'laga Yakobo ati', “Wu'ka u'ye ku' lwandi' lwa Beteli, u'kikale kwenu'ko, u'kanzyengele ihozezyo. Ene hu' ni' Mulungu u'yo ndi' wakwifumi'i'la aho wav'age u'mupeelile muku'lu'yo Esau.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yakobo wav'awi'laga v'antu' v'a mu lu'go lwakwe haki'mo na v'ose av'o wav'age nav'o ati', “Muvitage vimbulimbuli vya ki'geni i'vyo vili' hagati' na inywe. Mugalu'zye vizwalo vinywe na mwiv'ezezye wu'soso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' ku'wu'ke ku'ye ku' Beteli, nanne nkamuzyengele Mulungu ihozezyo kwenu'ko, u'yo ndi' wanyigwa lu'siku' lwa lu'duko lwanne, na ku'v'a haki'mo nanne ki'la u'ko ndi' naya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene v'amupaga Yakobo vimbulimbuli vya ki'geni vyose i'vyo vyav'age mu makono gav'o, na vipini vya mu matwi i'vyo v'av'age v'azwalile, nawe Yakobo waviv'isaga ha nsi'li'li' na muti' muhanya gwa mwaloni u'go gu'li' ku' lwandi' lwa Shekemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Yakobo na mugana gwakwe aho v'awu'kaga musi'nzo, Mulungu wav'atu'u'li'laga wov'a wu'hanya v'ikazi v'a kaya zyose i'zyo zyav'age ziv'apilimile, nav'o v'akagemile ku'v'alondezya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo na mugana gwakwe v'afikaga ku' Luzu, lina li'ngi' Beteli, ku' nsi' ya Kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wafikaga kwenu'ko, wazyengaga ihozezyo na wahitanaga henanho “El-beteli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “El-beteli” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “Mulungu wa Beteli.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",” ku'nguno henanho hu' Mulungu ndi' wamwifumi'i'la aho wav'age amupeelile muku'lu'ye Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo lyeni'lo Debola, muzya u'yo wav'age musu'ngi wamwa Lebeka, wagulalaga. Nawe wazyi'ki'lagwa ha nsi'li'li' na muti' gwa mwaloni, ku' lwandi' lwa dakama ya Beteli. Henanho Yakobo wahitanaga “Aloni-bakuti",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Aloni-bakuti” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “mwaloni gwa ki'li'lo”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yakobo wasu'v'aga ku'fuma ku' Padani-alamu, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwifumi'i'laga hangi' na ku'mudosya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Lina lyako u'li' Yakobo, ali'vi u'kasye witanwe hangi' Yakobo, sumbwa u'kwitanwa Izilaeli.” I'vi hu' vyene wamupaga lina Izilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wa Nguzu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Muhayo “Mulungu wa Nguzu” ku' Ki'ebulania gu'li' “El Shadai.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". U'v'e na wu'v'yalwa wingi muno. Mukingi'he, ku'nguno ku' wako ev'e nsi' na mbuto ya makabi'la, haki'mo na v'atemi v'alafumi'i'le ku' wu'v'yalwa wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsi' i'yo nav'apile Abalahamu na Isaka, nku'ku'pa ev'e na wu'v'yalwa wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Mulungu wamali'laga ku'yomba na Yakobo, wamulekaga haho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yakobo waki'ndi'kaga nhi'ngi' ya iwe ha lwandi' lwenu'lo aho wasu'nsu'mu'laga na Mulungu, hangi' wapu'ngu'li'laga kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'neneko haki'mo na maguta ha igu'lya na nhi'ngi' yeni'yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo wahitanaga henanho lina “Beteli,” aho Mulungu wasu'nsu'mu'laga nawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'v'yalwa kwamwa Benyamini na ku'fwa lwamwa nnina Lahele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Yakobo haki'mo na v'antu' v'akwe v'awu'kaga mu Beteli. Aho v'av'age v'akaali' katanalo ku'fika ku' Efulati, Lahele wadimagwa na wu'su'ngu' wu'daki muno wa ku'v'yala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga aho akaali' ali'tuka na wu'su'ngu' wu'daki, mwingi' wakwe wamuwi'laga ati', “Ku'du' wogohe, ku'nguno wapandi'ka mwana yu'ngi' wa ki'gosya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lahele aho myu'ye yakwe yi'li'mali'si'ka ku'nguno ndi' ali'fwa, haho wamupaga lina mwana mwenu'yo Benoni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Benoni” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “mwana wa misayo zyanne.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Ali'vi ise wamupaga lina Benyamini",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Benyamini” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “mwana wa mukono gwa mulyi'la,” ku'nguno lwandi' lwa mulyi'la lu'li' lwa kwelu'ki'lwa ku' ki'ti'lwe cha V'aebulania.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Lahele wagulalaga na wazyi'ki'lagwa ha mpelo na nzi'la i'yo yi'yile ku' Efulati, i'yo gi'si' yi'li'witanwa Betelehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo waki'ndi'kaga nhi'ngi' ya iwe ha igu'lya na ki'v'i'mbi', na yeni'yo hu' yi'li'lagi'la ki'v'i'mbi' chamwa Lahele mpaka walelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
